<title>USA: Omaha cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers active, fully $0.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Shipment Choice 2-4 1300 lbs 65.50. Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1000-1300 lbs 64.00-65.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mainly Choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 63.50-65.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
